			"updated": 1783373777079,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "What you need to know\n\n- Traversing a chain of nodes from head to null\n- Accessing fields (attributes) stored inside each node\n- Handling null pointer edge cases safely\n- Computing values (e.g. averages) while traversing",
			"rawText": "What you need to know\n\n- Traversing a chain of nodes from head to null\n- Accessing fields (attributes) stored inside each node\n- Handling null pointer edge cases safely\n- Computing values (e.g. averages) while traversing",
