			"updated": 1783373777079,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Go deeper\n\n- Inserting at head, tail, and a given middle position\n- Deleting a node (updating the previous node's pointer)\n- Doubly linked lists — pointers in both directions\n- Circular linked lists — tail points back to head",
			"rawText": "Go deeper\n\n- Inserting at head, tail, and a given middle position\n- Deleting a node (updating the previous node's pointer)\n- Doubly linked lists — pointers in both directions\n- Circular linked lists — tail points back to head",
