			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783353364102,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Implementation:\nTo add a node to the end, we follow these logical steps:\n\n1. Initialize a newNode.\n2. Check if the list is empty. If so, both head and tail become the newNode.\n3. If not empty, grab the current tail, point its next to the newNode, and then update the tail pointer itself to be the newNode.",
			"rawText": "Implementation:\nTo add a node to the end, we follow these logical steps:\n\n1. Initialize a newNode.\n2. Check if the list is empty. If so, both head and tail become the newNode.\n3. If not empty, grab the current tail, point its next to the newNode, and then update the tail pointer itself to be the newNode.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Implementation:\nTo add a node to the end, we follow these logical steps:\n\n1. Initialize a newNode.\n2. Check if the list is empty. If so, both head and tail become the newNode.\n3. If not empty, grab the current tail, point its next to the newNode, and then update the tail pointer itself to be the newNode.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
