			"updated": 1783355544119,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "2.3 Traversal Helper(traverseToIndex)\n\nSince insertions and deletions in the middle require us to traverse to a specific index, let's write a helper method. \nIt returns the Node at a given index.",
			"rawText": "2.3 Traversal Helper(traverseToIndex)\n\nSince insertions and deletions in the middle require us to traverse to a specific index, let's write a helper method. \nIt returns the Node at a given index.",
