			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783358654232,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(n) — Linear time.\n - Explanation: The actual pointer rewiring is O(1). \n   However, finding the insertion spot requires traversing the list from the head one node at a time until you \n   reach index - 1. That traversal takes  O(n) time.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(n) — Linear time.\n - Explanation: The actual pointer rewiring is O(1). \n   However, finding the insertion spot requires traversing the list from the head one node at a time until you \n   reach index - 1. That traversal takes  O(n) time.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "oOC9UwVBrNEYGcGlKUYl-",
			"originalText": "Time Complexity: O(n) — Linear time.\n - Explanation: The actual pointer rewiring is O(1). \n   However, finding the insertion spot requires traversing the list from the head one node at a time until you \n   reach index - 1. That traversal takes  O(n) time.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
