		{
			"id": "WUUHcgd1",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2014.2503615335072,
			"y": 3485.994599641428,
			"width": 1198.99853515625,
			"height": 100,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 0.5,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1z",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1710057563,
			"version": 1606,
			"versionNonce": 1299063831,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783370457857,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(n) — Linear time. (This is a major exam gotcha!)\n- Explanation: Even though we have a tail pointer, we can't just delete it. We need to update the second-to-\n  last node so its next pointer becomes null. Because pointers only go forward, we have to start at the head \n  and traverse the entire list to find that second-to-last node.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(n) — Linear time. (This is a major exam gotcha!)\n- Explanation: Even though we have a tail pointer, we can't just delete it. We need to update the second-to-\n  last node so its next pointer becomes null. Because pointers only go forward, we have to start at the head \n  and traverse the entire list to find that second-to-last node.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "f_1_hOAf6xQfAgsse2jHA",
			"originalText": "Time Complexity: O(n) — Linear time. (This is a major exam gotcha!)\n- Explanation: Even though we have a tail pointer, we can't just delete it. We need to update the second-to-\n  last node so its next pointer becomes null. Because pointers only go forward, we have to start at the head \n  and traverse the entire list to find that second-to-last node.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "sLlmUjcWO-6PN-_0MYh1f",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 2009.4449788595225,
			"y": 2327.3904141906037,
			"width": 1218.1999684784844,
			"height": 85,
