			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783359342437,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Deleting the tail is annoying in a Singly Linked List because you have to traverse the entire list to find the\nnode right before the tail so you can sever the connection.",
			"rawText": "Deleting the tail is annoying in a Singly Linked List because you have to traverse the entire list to find the node right before the tail so you can sever the connection.",
