			"text": "Best Case (O(1)): The needle is sitting perfectly at the head. The first check matches, and the method exits\nimmediately.\nWorst Case (O(n)): The value is sitting at the very end (tail) or isn't in the list at all. The pointer has to\nwalk through all n nodes before figuring this out.\nAverage Case (O(n)): The item is in the middle. Mathematically it takes n/2 checks, which simplifies\nasymptotically to linear time O(n).",
			"rawText": "Best Case (O(1)): The needle is sitting perfectly at the head. The first check matches, and the method exits immediately.\nWorst Case (O(n)): The value is sitting at the very end (tail) or isn't in the list at all. The pointer has to walk through all n nodes before figuring this out.\nAverage Case (O(n)): The item is in the middle. Mathematically it takes n/2 checks, which simplifies asymptotically to linear time O(n).",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "sE4MTUb0",
			"originalText": "Best Case (O(1)): The needle is sitting perfectly at the head. The first check matches, and the method exits immediately.\nWorst Case (O(n)): The value is sitting at the very end (tail) or isn't in the list at all. The pointer has to walk through all n nodes before figuring this out.\nAverage Case (O(n)): The item is in the middle. Mathematically it takes n/2 checks, which simplifies asymptotically to linear time O(n).",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
