			"updated": 1783369584304,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(n) across all cases. You have to touch every single node to get an accurate sum.\nSpace Complexity: O(1). You only store a couple of primitive primitive tracking numbers in memory.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(n) across all cases. You have to touch every single node to get an accurate sum.\nSpace Complexity: O(1). You only store a couple of primitive primitive tracking numbers in memory.",
