			"updated": 1783369584304,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(n) across all cases. Even if the maximum value is at the head, you still have to verify that\nno larger values exist later in the sequence.\nSpace Complexity: O(1).",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(n) across all cases. Even if the maximum value is at the head, you still have to verify that no larger values exist later in the sequence.\nSpace Complexity: O(1).",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "TgMAvbAL",
			"originalText": "Time Complexity: O(n) across all cases. Even if the maximum value is at the head, you still have to verify that no larger values exist later in the sequence.\nSpace Complexity: O(1).",
