		{
			"id": "VMR8As8Q",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3356.5658271272655,
			"y": 3790.491679902864,
			"width": 1228.6611074931598,
			"height": 100,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b4O",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 681766967,
			"version": 357,
			"versionNonce": 1548091961,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783370918767,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "In a sequence like A -> B -> C, mutating the next pointer of node B to face backward toward A (A <- B)\nimmediately severes its connection to C. Because node B was the sole reference link to node C, breaking this\nbond leaves the remainder of the downstream sequence isolated in heap memory. In Java, this leaves the orphaned\nnodes unreachable, making them subject to immediate garbage collection.",
			"rawText": "In a sequence like A -> B -> C, mutating the next pointer of node B to face backward toward A (A <- B) immediately severes its connection to C. Because node B was the sole reference link to node C, breaking this bond leaves the remainder of the downstream sequence isolated in heap memory. In Java, this leaves the orphaned nodes unreachable, making them subject to immediate garbage collection.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "In a sequence like A -> B -> C, mutating the next pointer of node B to face backward toward A (A <- B) immediately severes its connection to C. Because node B was the sole reference link to node C, breaking this bond leaves the remainder of the downstream sequence isolated in heap memory. In Java, this leaves the orphaned nodes unreachable, making them subject to immediate garbage collection.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "ZZYjEggP",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3361.0649401160767,
			"y": 3913.02622022642,
			"width": 714.9992065429688,
			"height": 50,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
